<title>MALAYSIA: Advance Synergy in China hotel deal.</title>
<headline>Advance Synergy in China hotel deal.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advance Synergy Bhd (ASB) said it has teamed up with Hong Kong-based Excellent Trade and Development Ltd (ETDL) to buy a four-star hotel in Shenzen, China, for 40,000 renminbi or around 12.6 million ringgit.</p>
<p>ASB said it signed a deal with ETDL on November 27 to acquire the Holiday Villa Shenzen hotel.</p>
<p>It added that the purchase will be carried out by a joint-venture company, Asbina Shenzen, incorporated in the British Virgin Islands.</p>
<p>Asbina, with an authorised share capital of $50,000, is 90 percent controlled by ASB, with the balance 10 percent held by ETDL.</p>
